  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2140\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/de/Flag_of_the_United_States.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20170818144039\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the United States.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_United_States.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2136\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2136\">2136</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 8, 2140</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2144\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2144\">2144</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All eligible voters who turned out</small><br /><small>51% of votes votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">80.7%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151107015223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151107015223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Fabian\" title=\"Cora Fabian\">Cora Fabian</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Syng Anderson\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Union Party\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Oklahoma</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">England</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>Mika Sakahki</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Ian Binshaieg\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,453,101,034</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">1,217,314,803\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>53.1%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">44.4%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Fabian\" title=\"Cora Fabian\">Cora Fabian</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2140</b> was the 89th quadrennial presidential election. Vice President <a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Fabian\" title=\"Cora Fabian\">Cora Fabian</a> won the election.&#160;\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205721\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2404/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9949/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3187/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 7/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1016911/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.005      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   74.005      1 -total\n 75.46%   55.844      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 34.29%   25.379     10 Template:Ifempty\n  8.24%    6.101      1 Template:Flagicon\n  6.41%    4.745      4 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  5.95%    4.406      1 Template:Country_data_United_States\n  2.90%    2.145      1 Template:Flagicon/core\n  2.34%    1.729     42 Template:!-\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1804-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205721 and revision id 4833. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
